# Stray PNGs anywhere (scratch renders, screenshots) stay out of the repo, but
# the game's own art under src/gfx must be tracked -- a blanket *.png meant new
# sprites were silently missing from a fresh clone, so CI built a different game
# than the one on the dev machine. (It also forced `git add -f` for every new
# sprite, which is why gfx/3d/princess/normals/walk2.png.wow carries that
# suffix: renaming it was how it got past this rule.)
*.png
!src/gfx/**/*.png

# ...except the atlas pipeline's own outputs, which are rebuilt by
# tools/pack_atlas.py and should never be committed.
src/gfx/atlas/atlas.png
src/gfx/atlas/atlas2.png

